{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15147","headline":"送韩将军还边 · 李益","name":"送韩将军还边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白马羽林儿，扬鞭薄暮时。\n独将轻骑出，暗与伏兵期。\n雨雪移军远，旌旗上壠迟。\n圣心戎寄重，未许让恩私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}